# .claude-context — nutrition-labels repo map (token-optimized)

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript, Vite, Zustand (recipe/saved/prefs/theme),
  React Query, Tailwind, `@react-pdf/renderer` for **client-side PDFs**
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLite (read-only, FTS5), slowapi — data endpoints ONLY
  (no PDF pipeline; the WeasyPrint route was retired)
- **Infra**: docker-compose — db-init → backend(:8000) + frontend(nginx) behind Caddy TLS

